                    <p class="eyebrow">Fabrication · Testing · Materials</p>
                    <h1>Advanced Materials Laboratory</h1>
                    <p class="subtitle">From printed specimens to measured behavior.</p>
                    <p class="hero-intro">A series of course experiments connecting polymer fabrication with mechanical testing, thermal analysis, and material characterization.</p>
                    <div class="project-meta"><span>Tuskegee University</span><span>Spring 2024</span><span>MENG 0319</span></div>
                    <p class="status">Completed laboratory coursework and individual reports</p>
                    <a class="text-link" href="#contributions">My work <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
                </div>
